		<name>Battery Monitor</name>
		<summary>Local battery estimates and app usage history</summary>
		<desc>Battery Monitor shows Android's per-app charge estimates, available
foreground/background estimates, wakelocks and the system battery timeline.
It keeps validated usage history on your device, without ads, accounts,
internet permission or telemetry. Android 14 or later is required.

Collection requires ADB permission grants or Shizuku. This early public beta
is an independent GPLv3-or-later Wattdog fork; estimates and physical-device
behavior still need validation. Uninstalling removes saved history.

Setup and limitations: https://github.com/Sivivatu/battery-monitor#install-and-enable-collection
</desc>
